sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant API as GenerateDocService API
    participant Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL task store
    participant Outbox as Outbox dispatcher
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ via MassTransit
    participant Worker
    participant Engine as Selected document engine
    participant MinIO

    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/documents/async
    API->>Redis: Reserve request fingerprint
    API->>DB: Commit task and outbox payload atomically
    API-->>Client: 202 Accepted + taskId

    Outbox->>DB: Claim pending message with lease
    Outbox->>MQ: Send GenerateDocumentRequested
    MQ-->>Outbox: Broker accepted message
    Outbox->>DB: Clear pending payload
    MQ->>Worker: Deliver generation request
    Worker->>DB: Load task, set Processing
    Worker->>Redis: Lookup generated document by fingerprint
    alt Generation succeeds
        alt Cached document exists
            Redis-->>Worker: Cached document and artifact reference
        else Cache miss
            Worker->>Engine: GenerateAsync(request)
            Engine-->>Worker: Generated document
            Worker->>MinIO: Save artifact
            MinIO-->>Worker: Artifact storage path
            Worker->>Redis: Cache generated document and artifact reference
        end
        Worker->>DB: Set Completed with artifact path
        Worker->>MQ: Publish DocumentGenerated
    else Generation fails after retries
        Worker->>DB: Set Failed with error
        Worker->>MQ: Publish DocumentGenerationFailed
    end

    loop Poll until Completed or Failed
        Client->>API: GET /api/v1/tasks/{taskId}
        API->>DB: Read task status
        DB-->>API: Current task status
        API-->>Client: Status and download URL when complete
    end

    alt Task completed
        Client->>API: GET /api/v1/tasks/{taskId}/download
        API->>DB: Read completed task and artifact path
        DB-->>API: Artifact storage path
        API->>MinIO: Read artifact through IDocumentArtifactStore
        MinIO-->>API: Generated file
        API-->>Client: 200 OK + document bytes
    else Task failed
        Client-->>Client: Display task error
    end